{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"28f23b1c29684f7fc0c9a8fbac0f084a278c7745ea5c81d8b9d662fe9a127da6","digest":{"component_or_area":"plan-review gate, plan-relation-snapshot reducer","key_entities":["rebar review-plan","plan-relation-snapshot","tickets-tracker",".tickets-tracker","plan_relation_snapshot_error","reducer-error","_store/event_append._prepare_event","os.makedirs","ignore_untracked"],"problem_keywords":["plan-relation reducer","event-less directory","plan review","INDETERMINATE verdict","store detritus","orphan ticket directory"],"propositions":["A ticket directory with no CREATE or SNAPSHOT event causes the plan-relation reducer to fail, surfacing as INDETERMINATE verdict on unrelated tickets in the same relation graph","Empty ticket directories are created by writers crashing after makedirs but before writing the first event, and persist invisibly in local clones because git cannot track empty directories","The plan-review snapshot walks the store directory tree and encounters orphan event-less directories, which should be skipped with a warning rather than failing the entire snapshot","The reducer must tolerate event-less directories as a reader-side fix rather than preventing their creation, because writer-side cleanup cannot cover process-death window orphans and would race under concurrent writes"]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787693621474249001,"uuid":"ddfd9606-6a28-41ce-859f-0f588d727de7"}